Recommends: pkexec | policykit-1
Description: one window for every package manager
 DepMan detects the package managers installed on the system (APT, Snap,
 Flatpak, pip, pipx, npm and Cargo) and lists what each one installed in
 its own tab.
 .
 Each package has a page showing its version, description and where its
 files live, with buttons to uninstall, purge, update or reinstall it.
